OL,3,AThousands of teens missing education
OL,4,A'under the radar' of official stats,
OL,5,Areport warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere could be tens of thousands more
OL,8,Fteenagers who are not in education,
OL,9,Femployment or training (Neet) than
OL,10,Fofficial statistics suggest, the
OL,11,Fchildren's commissioner has warned.
OL,13,FA report by Dame Rachel de Souza said
OL,14,Faround 42,000 16- and 17-year-olds were
OL,15,Fofficially classed as studying at
OL,16,Fcollege, but were not showing up at
OL,17,Fleast half of the time.
OL,19,FShe said they had gone "under the
OL,20,Fradar" and were "not getting the
OL,21,Fsupport that they need".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
